 "notes": "Tile is mostly institutional (school/college complexes) plus two private-house blocks at x -262..-162. Parking traced only where cars/bays are visible: marked-bay lot (-337..-319, 27..61), perpendicular row along the main road (-452..-441, -25..-55), fenced market lot (-242..-168, -91..-147), roadside bays (-159..-150, -24..-46) and a verge row east of the street at x~-160. No playground equipment anywhere in the tile: model playground-to-verify P1 (-406,-41) is paved forecourt with a flower bed, P17 (-355,-142) is paving south of the turf pitch. School pitch is artificial turf (-388..-346, -115..-139); the rest of the model Sport_Pitch there is a bare-soil workout area plus paving. Model Sport_Pitch at (-380..-337, 29..58) is a bare-soil yard and partly lies under a missing 1-storey green-roof building. Unpaved lane (~4 m) between the long warehouse and the west house block is missing in the model (alley, dead end at y~-80). OSM streets/buildings here sit 1-5 m west of the Yandex image; street-side plot walls were snapped to the model street corridor (off carriageway and sidewalk), inner plot divisions follow the image. Larger light-grey hall at (-225..-201, -20..0) is only partly in the model (smaller footprint) - left as is."
